OL,3,GNEWSACity 'on song' for international
OL,4,Achoir festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 choirs from around the
OL,7,Fworld are arriving in Londonderry for
OL,8,Fone of the UK's largest choral
OL,9,Ffestivals.
OL,11,FChoristers from Sweden, Estonia,
OL,12,FFrance, Germany, the UK and Ireland
OL,13,Fwill rub shoulders with local singers
OL,14,Fof all ages for the four-day City of
OL,15,FDerry International Choir Festival.
OL,17,FNow in its 14th year, a record number
OL,18,Fof choirs are taking part with a
OL,19,Fvariety of performances and
OL,20,Fcompetitions.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
