OL,3,GNEWSACity 'on song' for international
OL,4,Achoir festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt opens on Thursday with a gala
OL,7,Fconcert at the Millennium Forum,
OL,8,Ffeaturing the Ulster Orchestra and
OL,9,FFestival Chorus under the direction of
OL,10,Fnewly-appointed chief conductor Anna
OL,11,FHandler.
